swaylock, a screen locker for Wayland (ext-session-lock). Built WITHOUT PAM: it verifies your password against /etc/shadow, so the binary is installed setuid root and your user needs a real password. gdk-pixbuf is enabled for background images (PNG, JPEG).
upstream: https://github.com/swaywm/swaylock
